{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Which is upon the edut.</b> על in the sense of next to, as in על המערכת, and וסכות על הארון, and הוא עומד על הגמלים." "<b>He shall arrange it.</b> For this reason the lamps of the Menorah are called נרות המערכה. <b>Aharon and his sons</b> — or his sons." "<b>From evening to morning.</b> The Sages measured its portion: a half-log, and there was nothing left over, for they would make thick wicks corresponding to the shortness of the nights."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:45.493328132Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}